 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "SecondBrainSystem() starts empty. Times are passed in by the caller and never decrease across createNote, updateNote and revertNote calls. createNote(title, content, timestamp) returns the next id \"note1\", \"note2\", ... (ids are never reused). getNote(noteId) returns [title, content, createdAt, updatedAt] or [] when absent. updateNote(noteId, title, content, timestamp) replaces title and content, sets updatedAt and returns true, or returns false when absent. deleteNote(noteId) returns whether a note was removed. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk10-a-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
